using S

~ start
Merchant: What do you want to buy?
- Pay the toll [if res_coins >= 5 /]
	Merchant: Hand over 5 coins?
	- Yes [if flag_honest == true /]
		The merchant smiles and hands you the key.
		do set_flag paid true
	- No
		The merchant frowns and turns away.
	do add_res coins -5
- Walk away
	You walk away empty-handed.
